# Lab 05 - File Permissions Basics

## Overview

This lab focuses on Linux file permissions and demonstrates how to control file access and execution rights.

## Commands Practiced

```bash
ls -l
chmod 755 script.sh
chmod +x script.sh
```

## Key Concepts

- Read Permissions
- Write Permissions
- Execute Permissions
- Access Control

## Practical Outcome

Successfully modified file permissions and controlled access to system resources.
